function peopleImportProfileRichness(profile){return[String(profile?.summary||''),...(profile?.coreTraits||[]),...(profile?.values||[]),String(profile?.emotionExpression||''),String(profile?.defenseResponse||''),String(profile?.intimacyStyle||'')].join('').trim().length;}
function finalizePeopleProfile(profile,chunkProfiles,allowedRefs){const refs=[...allowedRefs].filter(ref=>typeof ref==='string').slice(0,24),chunks=Array.isArray(chunkProfiles)?chunkProfiles:[],richest=[...chunks].sort((a,b)=>peopleImportProfileRichness(b)-peopleImportProfileRichness(a))[0];let result=profile;if(!peopleImportProfileRichness(result)&&peopleImportProfileRichness(richest))result={...richest};if(!peopleImportProfileRichness(result))result={...result,summary:'성격 미확인',coreTraits:[],values:[],emotionExpression:'',defenseResponse:'',intimacyStyle:'',axes:Object.fromEntries(PERSONALITY_AXES.map(axis=>[axis,50]))};if(!result.overview||result.overview===OVERVIEW_UNKNOWN){const overview=chunks.map(item=>item.overview).filter(text=>text&&text!==OVERVIEW_UNKNOWN).sort((a,b)=>b.length-a.length)[0];result={...result,overview:overview||OVERVIEW_UNKNOWN};}return{...result,evidenceRefs:[...new Set([...(result.evidenceRefs||[]),...refs])].filter(ref=>allowedRefs.has(ref)).slice(0,24)};}
async function peopleImportCompileProfile({person,related,wikiScope=null,reservedPeople=[],sourceCheck=null,seed,traceStore,preset,scope,api,keyStore,signal,stagePrefix='People profile',sexualDesireEnabled=false,paraphiliaEnabled=false,explicitSexualStyleEnabled=false}){const identityNames=[...(person.identityNames||[person.name,...person.aliases])],fixedNames=new Set(identityNames.map(peopleImportMetadataKey));if(wikiScope){const prepared=peopleImportMetadataForCandidate(wikiScope,{...person,id:'compile:active',identityNames,profile:{},tags:[],aliases:person.aliases||[]},reservedPeople);person={...person,identityNames,aliases:prepared.aliases,metadataNotes:prepared.metadataNotes};}else person={...person,identityNames};const allowedRefs=new Set(related.map(item=>item.ref)),groups=chunkPeopleImportSources(related),options={sexualDesireEnabled:Boolean(sexualDesireEnabled),paraphiliaEnabled:Boolean(paraphiliaEnabled),explicitSexualStyleEnabled:Boolean(explicitSexualStyleEnabled)},validator=(raw,context)=>{const value=peopleImportValidateProfile(raw,{...context,...options});if(!fixedNames.has(peopleImportMetadataKey(value.name)))throw new Error('People profile 응답이 요청한 인물 이름과 일치하지 않습니다.');return value;};if(!groups.length)throw new Error('People profile에 사용할 관련 source가 없습니다.');let profiles=[];for(let index=0;index<groups.length;index++){const requestRef=`req:people_profile_${peopleImportFnv(`${seed}|part|${index}`)}`,prompt=peopleImportProfilePrompt(person,groups[index],requestRef,options);profiles.push(await peopleImportCallValidated({traceStore,stage:stagePrefix,preset,prompt,scope,requestRef,allowedRefs,validator,api,keyStore,signal,sourceCheck}));}const chunkProfiles=[...profiles];let round=0;while(profiles.length>1){const next=[];for(let index=0;index<profiles.length;index+=4){const group=profiles.slice(index,index+4),requestRef=`req:people_profile_merge_${peopleImportFnv(`${seed}|${round}|${index}`)}`,prompt=peopleImportProfilePrompt(person,group,requestRef,options);next.push(await peopleImportCallValidated({traceStore,stage:`${stagePrefix} merge`,preset,prompt,scope,requestRef,allowedRefs,validator,api,keyStore,signal,sourceCheck}));}profiles=next;round++;}const profile=finalizePeopleProfile(profiles[0],chunkProfiles,allowedRefs),expected=fixedNames;if(!expected.has(peopleImportMetadataKey(profile.name)))throw new Error('People profile 인물 이름이 discovery 후보와 일치하지 않습니다.');let aliases=[person.name,...person.aliases],tags=[],metadataNotes=[...(person.metadataNotes||[])];for(const part of [...chunkProfiles,profile]){const checked=peopleImportSourceAliases(aliases,part.aliases,related.filter(source=>(part.evidenceRefs||[]).includes(source.ref)));aliases=checked.aliases;metadataNotes.push(...(part.metadataNotes||[]),...checked.metadataNotes);tags.push(...(part.tags||[]));}return{...profile,name:person.name,aliases:aliases.filter(alias=>peopleImportMetadataKey(alias)!==peopleImportMetadataKey(person.name)),tags:peopleImportMetadataList(tags,{kind:'tag',limit:16,notes:metadataNotes}),metadataNotes:[...new Set(metadataNotes)].slice(0,12)};}

function peopleImportMerge(discovered){const merged=[];for(const person of discovered){const names=[person.name,...person.aliases].map(peopleImportNorm).filter(Boolean),matches=merged.filter(item=>[item.name,...item.aliases].map(peopleImportNorm).some(name=>names.includes(name)));if(matches.length===1){const target=matches[0];target.aliases=[...new Set([...target.aliases,...person.aliases].filter(alias=>peopleImportNorm(alias)!==peopleImportNorm(target.name)))].slice(0,PEOPLE_IMPORT_LIMITS.aliases);target.sourceRefs=[...new Set([...target.sourceRefs,...person.sourceRefs])].slice(0,48);}else merged.push({...person,aliases:person.aliases.filter(alias=>peopleImportNorm(alias)!==peopleImportNorm(person.name))});}return merged.slice(0,PEOPLE_IMPORT_LIMITS.candidates);}
